tde2e is built from source using the tdlib/td submodule at TMessagesProj/jni/td.

The build is automated via the buildNativeLibs Gradle task (see TMessagesProj/build.gradle).
To build manually, from TMessagesProj/jni/:

  git submodule update --init TMessagesProj/jni/td
  export NDK=/path/to/ndk
  export NINJA_PATH=$(which ninja)
  bash build_tde2e.sh

build_tde2e.sh requires BoringSSL to be already built (run build_boringssl.sh first).
Output: tde2e/build/{arm64-v8a,armeabi-v7a,x86_64,x86}/libtde2e.a and libtdutils.a

Files in this directory:
  bridge.cpp       -- JNI bridge compiled into the main .so (source)
  include/         -- Public API header (e2e_api.h)
  build/           -- Built static libraries (generated, not in git)
  README           -- This file
